  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Access to education for children in conflict zones</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Since 2006, Visions for Children has been committed to ensuring that every child is given the opportunity to obtain a basic education with which they can acquire fundamental skills. We particularly build on and contribute to the fourth sustainability goal of the United Nations&apos; Agenda 2030 - namely to ensure an equitable and high-quality education. We see schools as anchor points that give children the chance of a self-determined future by means of capacity building within the entire region.</narrative>
  </description>
